  "stageId": "spst_08-02",
  "title": "燃烧的片段2",
  "storyCode": "EG-2",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_08-02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9a5e21f049d679364394f225a924ebe86f74e8df7ebed277445058d1d95ae1ae",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "切割，穿刺，劈砍，横扫，利刃在敌人之中飞舞。\n哭喊，怒骂，诅咒，嚎叫，而后一切归于平静。\n迷迭香的表情没有任何变化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "解决了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "已经没有阵地和伏击点，可以继续前进了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "干得漂亮，菲林。我们的人甚至还没有受伤就结束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "而且，你刺穿他们头颅的速度很快，很准，很果断，这样很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "如果不是知道是你杀的大尉，我可能会希望你加入我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "你是个天生的战士，你跟着那只卡特斯，很可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "不许你说阿米娅的坏话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "不，我并没有在批评她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "她说了一些我很久很久以前想听，也听过的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "她很好，菲林，她真好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "但是，这行不通，菲林，这行不通。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "我不信，阿米娅一定能够做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "或许吧，但你跟着她，对你对她都不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "你们是两类人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "什么两类人？我和阿米娅关系很好，她教会了我许多事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "......呵，你会懂的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "装神弄鬼......我也不想知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "你刚才说，我能加入你们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "你可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "我们欢迎任何人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "只要你为感染者的命运感到不公，只要你对乌萨斯感到愤怒，只要你想要战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "你就可以加入我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "你以为我们的队伍里只有乌萨斯人，只有这个国家的子民？不是的，菲林。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "......你也是菲林。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "我生长在雷姆必拓，随着父母来到乌萨斯，然后在这片寒冷的土地扎根。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "我从小喜欢和人打架，于是后来决定参军。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "虽然乌萨斯的参军测验对菲林来说有些严苛，但我还是成功了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "然后，我进了大尉的部队，我跟着大尉四处征战，这一打，就是十年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "战争，紧跟着战争，还有下一场战争，这就是乌萨斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "我曾经为这个国家感到骄傲，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "我们之中，有无数人都曾为这个国家感到骄傲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "那么，为什么......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "因为我的父母感染了矿石病，被赶出了城市，死在了荒野上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "而我甚至在他们死后的半年后才知道这件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "......？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "我们之中，有无数人经历过类似的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "我听到你也经历了类似的事情，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "但不只是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "如果只是这样，如果我只是凑巧不幸的那一个，我甚至或许可以理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "但是，不是这样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "战争曾经是我脑中唯一存在且应该完成的事业。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "我在那时才开始思考一些事情，才开始去了解这个国家，去尝试理解这个我曾为之奋斗的国家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "如果没有大尉，我可能已经因为在司令部出言不逊而进军事法庭了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "然后，我跟着大尉走入了北原。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "而后一路走到了今天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "在这之中，我学会了忍耐，学会了愤怒，学会了憎恨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "......阿米娅对我说，不要学会这些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "你总会学会的，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "如果你不会运用它们，你就会被它们吞没。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "所以，爱国者是你的亲人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "我们共同奋战了二十年，他是我最好的兄弟，最亲的战友，最尊敬的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "他是，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "但我依然要说，你更适合加入我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "那阿米娅能够加入你们吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "那只卡特斯？不，她不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "她不能加入我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "那我不会加入你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "哈，我也说了，因为你杀了大尉，你不可能加入我们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "我不在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "但要我说的话，你要多注意一下她，她想要保护你，但她可能比你死得更快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "为什么你这么肯定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "因为我们曾经见过这样的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "盾卫似乎回想起了什么，不再理会迷迭香，重新戴上头盔，向着他的战友走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
